  "status": "answered",
  "answer": "According to Estuary Instruments' order process, an order must include the following specific details: an SKU, quantity, delivery address, and purchase-order reference. The minimum order subtotal is INR 3000 before tax and shipping. Item subtotals can be calculated using unit prices and quantities from the catalogue, but final payable totals cannot be presented as such due to the exclusion of tax and shipping. The supplier does not guarantee arrival dates; lead times are estimates in working days (Monday to Friday, excluding holidays) and are not calendar-day-based from user queries. Orders for mixed suppliers are handled separately, as one supplier's subtotal cannot satisfy another's minimum.",
  "evidence": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "8c3fea60d5f19727",
      "quote": "The minimum order subtotal for Estuary Instruments is INR 3000 before tax and shipping. Orders must include an SKU, quantity, delivery address and purchase-order reference."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "8c3fea60d5f19727",
      "quote": "Catalogue prices are in INR and exclude tax and shipping. The documents do not specify tax rates or shipping charges. Item subtotals therefore cannot be presented as final payable totals."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "8c3fea60d5f19727",
      "quote": "Quoted lead times are working days from written order acceptance, not calendar days from a user query. The supplier operates Monday to Friday, excluding supplier holidays."
    }
  ]
}
